  "title": "Bonnie S NDE 147",
  "date": "May 2001",
  "content": "I was floating upward. I was thinking how I wasn't having any pain. My neck and shoulders had been in a spasm for about two days. It was the first time in five years that I could feel warmth. The light was so bright, and warm, it had a yellow hue about it. (I told people that if the light was that bright it would blind you.) It was bright, but warm and calming at the same time. I could hear voices, none were familiar to me. At first, I didn't understand, but it became clear. It wasn't time for me. I wanted to stay. I was at peace.",
